   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Previously, Ivan failed to convince his family to support him at the upcoming debates. Meanwhile, back in the communal apartment, Arkady and young Lyosha resume their war game, but the physical roughhousing ends with an unexpected injury.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
