   "t": "Хорошо, держи гранату!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Alright, take the grenade!' Arkady tosses an imaginary explosive at the boy.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
